    "detailed_description": "Continuation of the first part.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n2025, between the powers began the race for space exploration. A large number of rockets were sent into space to build several large space stations. The main goal was to study the microorganisms of asteroids, a frozen organism was discovered on one of the asteroids, as it seemed at first harmless.<br />\r\nAfter some time, it began to evolve and it needs a carrier, a person approached this role not badly! 90% of the stations were infected with an unknown virus, the evolution process has begun, in a short time there is little left of people.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou assume the role of the propagandist Nikolai, who is the commander of the special forces, in the Alpha squad.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n\u2022 Modern graphics - realistic layout in sci-fi styles.<br />\r\n\u2022 More than 10 types of weapons.<br />\r\n\u2022 The bosses.<br />\r\n\u2022 Realistic visual effects - photorealistic visual effects.<br />\r\n\u2022 A large number of enemies - engage in a tough battle with enemies, explore the dark scary corridors.<br />\r\n\u2022 Excellent lighting - properly selected lighting creates an atmosphere of horror.<br />\r\n\u2022 The effect of time dilation.<br />\r\n\u2022 Dynamism.<br />\r\n\u2022 High-quality sounds - well-chosen and high-quality audio signals, as well as a soundtrack that fills the atmosphere of the game.<br />\r\n\u2022 High-quality shaders.",
